stemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td style="padding:40px 20px 24px"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:10px"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:32px"><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:24px;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin:0 0 28px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:28px;margin-left:0">North Rental</p><h1 style="color:#0a0a0a;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 20px">Return label for your rental</h1><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Hello Anna Kowalska,</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Your rental ends on 23 July 2026. The return label is attached — print it, stick it on the parcel and ship it back.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#f7f7f7;border-radius:8px"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 16px"><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8;padding:10px 0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><strong>Order number<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->AV-2026-001</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8;padding:10px 0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><strong>Shipment number<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->GK240610123456</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8;padding:10px 0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><strong>Carrier<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Przewoźnik X</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">The return label (PDF) is attached to this message.</p><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e8e8e8;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:28px 0 20px"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;margin:0;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">North Rental<br/>This is an automated message about your rental.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "text": "North Rental


RETURN LABEL FOR YOUR RENTAL

Hello Anna Kowalska,

